+* **`docs/tickets.json` has no `full_verify` key**, so `cmd_close`'s
+  `load_tickets().get("full_verify")` is always `None` and the "full regression suite"
+  protocol rule 5 promises has never run for any ticket. Independent of the above;
+  reported, not touched (the file is PROTECTED).
+
+---
+
